<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on German stocks.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on German stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products Guernsey has issued 500,000 European-style warrants, on Muenchener Rueckversicherungs-Gesellschaft, lead manager BfG Bank AG, Frankfurt said.</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.15 DEM</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.DEC.96		 PAYDATE	22.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
